    "On Home, check your day streak and this month rings, then use Take Now or Missed when you finish or skip a dose. Tap a streak colour to see that reminder’s details." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On Home, check your day streak and this month rings, then use Take Now or Missed when you finish or skip a dose. Tap a streak colour to see that reminder’s details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在首頁查看連續天數與本月環形統計，服用或錯過時使用「現在服用」或「錯過」。點擊連續天數的顏色可查看該提醒詳情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile → Manage Medications. Add each medicine and dose, then choose which reminder times it should use — or keep All times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Profile → Manage Medications. Add each medicine and dose, then choose which reminder times it should use — or keep All times."
