        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "前往個人資料 → 管理藥物。新增每種藥物與劑量，再選擇對應的提醒時間，或維持「所有時間」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile → Reminder Times. Add one or more daily alarms (for example Morning, Afternoon, and Night), and pick a custom time for each." : {
